          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## LGOS request tracing\n\nChoose a **Trace ID** from **Recent prompt requests**, then select **Show nested trace** or **Open in Langfuse**. Each prompt trace starts at the UI backend's outbound OpenAI-compatible request and continues through Traefik, Bifrost, LGOS, and LangGraph. Browser login, page-load, model-catalog, and WebSocket connection traces are separate operational traces. Bifrost preserves the W3C trace, but its span and the downstream LGOS server span can appear as siblings because the current gateway forwards the inbound parent unchanged.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.1.1",
      "targets": [],
      "title": "",
      "type": "text"
    },
